# Nested git worktrees are whole second checkouts of this repository. Without
# this, knip walks into them and reports them as THIS repo's dead code --
# measured at 661 phantom violations and a commit gate that blocked every
# commit. This file predates `guardrails init` and carries no
# `guardrails:start`/`end` markers, so the shipped GITIGNORE_BLOCK does not
# reach it; the entry has to be kept here by hand.
.claude/worktrees/
